41997755fa70"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Below, we derive the series solutions for the four MB integrals considered \
above. Since these series will be combined in a master formula to reconstruct \
the original integral, they must all share a ",
 StyleBox["common",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " region of convergence. For our checks, we choose the region u < 1 and v < \
1. Accordingly, we select different ",
 StyleBox["SeriesNumber",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " values below so that, for each MB integral, the chosen series solution \
converges in this region u < 1 and v < 1."
}], "Text",
